│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ folded_waterfill_eplb                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation replaces the item-by-item Python greedy packer with a vectorized      │
│                          │ folded block-packing strategy. Experts are sorted by load, split into equal-capacity      │
│                          │ blocks, and each block is assigned so its heaviest entries go to the currently lightest   │
│                          │ packs. This preserves exact per-device capacity while substantially reducing Python-loop  │
│                          │ overhead.                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Replica allocation uses a batched marginal water-filling formulation. Instead of          │
│                          │ repeatedly computing a maximum for every additional replica, it selects the largest       │
│                          │ replica-benefit marginals in one `topk` operation when the candidate matrix is reasonably │
│                          │ sized. This produces the same minimax-style replica allocation principle while improving  │
│                          │ parallelism. A memory-safe iterative fallback is retained for unusually large             │
│                          │ configurations.                                                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The hierarchy remains topology-aware: groups are first distributed across nodes, replicas │
│                          │ are created only within node-local expert pools, and physical replicas are then folded    │
│                          │ onto GPUs within each node.                                                               │
