│ patch_description        │ Add an optional bounded pair-swap refinement to the cardinality-constrained LPT packing.  │
│                          │ LPT is fast but can leave avoidable imbalance because it never revisits early             │
│                          │ assignments. After the initial heap-based placement, the refinement swaps one item        │
│                          │ between the currently heaviest and lightest packs when that strictly reduces their        │
│                          │ squared-load objective. This preserves the exact number of experts per pack and rank      │
│                          │ uniqueness while reducing load variance. The iteration budget is bounded by the number of │
│                          │ packs, making the additional work small for typical node/GPU counts.                      │
