│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ swap_refined_packing                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Add a bounded local-search refinement after the cardinality-constrained greedy packing    │
│                          │ pass. The existing LPT-style greedy assignment is fast but can leave a heavy and light    │
│                          │ pack with complementary items whose exchange significantly reduces the load range. For a  │
│                          │ small fixed number of iterations, the refinement considers only the current heaviest and  │
│                          │ lightest packs in every layer, evaluates all slot exchanges in a vectorized tensor        │
│                          │ operation, and applies the best exchange that transfers positive load without reversing   │
│                          │ the pack ordering.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This preserves the exact number of experts per pack and all output-map invariants. It     │
│                          │ improves both node group placement and GPU physical-expert placement because both stages  │
│                          │ use `balanced_packing`, while avoiding an expensive general combinatorial search.         │
