│ patch_description        │ This revision keeps the complete planning pipeline on the input tensor device, removing   │
│                          │ the unconditional CPU transfer and preserving output-device locality. It also avoids      │
│                          │ rebuilding ranks for the common non-refined packing path by recording ranks during LPT    │
│                          │ assignment.                                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ For GPU placement, the refinement step now selects swaps whose transferred load is        │
│                          │ closest to half of the current heavy/light load gap. This minimizes the post-swap maximum │
│                          │ load more effectively than selecting the largest valid transfer. Refinement remains       │
│                          │ bounded to small layouts and fixed rounds, avoiding host synchronization and keeping      │
│                          │ planning latency predictable.                                                             │
