│ patch_description        │ Remove the Python-level all-pairs swap refinement from `balanced_packing`. The refinement │
│                          │ has quadratic work in the number of items per pack for every candidate pack pair and is   │
│                          │ invoked both for node placement and GPU placement. The observed metrics show that it      │
│                          │ materially increases algorithm and inference time without improving either reported       │
│                          │ balancedness score. The heap-based LPT assignment remains the primary load-balancing      │
│                          │ heuristic, preserves the fixed cardinality constraint exactly, and assigns ranks directly │
│                          │ during placement to avoid maintaining and rescanning per-pack Python lists.               │
